{"unit_id":"SZMY-haruhi__dsh-tavily#card-zh","repo":"SZMY-haruhi/dsh-tavily","commit":"b22e85a818738d30d2061def85b3ce088707ab67","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tavily 是面向 DSH Web 的 Tavily 网页搜索插件，为 DSH 的 web 搜索提供 Tavily 搜索提供商。插件通过注册搜索提供商接入 web，并在插件页提供配置卡片，可切换 Tavily 与官方 DeepSeek 搜索。启用后可使用 Tavily keyless 模式，也可配置 API Key 使用账户模式；搜索请求支持结果数量设置、超时与中止处理，并过滤缺少链接的结果。配置卡片支持编辑开关和密钥、保存或放弃修改，并可发起连通测试。适合希望在 DSH Web 中使用 Tavily 搜索，或按需切换回官方搜索的用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:202-227","lib/index.js:249-269","lib/client.js:540-568"]}
{"unit_id":"SZMY-haruhi__dsh-tavily#card-en","repo":"SZMY-haruhi/dsh-tavily","commit":"b22e85a818738d30d2061def85b3ce088707ab67","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-tavily adds Tavily web search to DSH Web. Its Plugins-page card switches between Tavily and official DeepSeek search. Tavily works without a key or with an API key. Searches support result limits, timeout and cancellation; the card also offers a connection test.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:202-227","lib/index.js:249-269","lib/client.js:540-568"]}
