{"unit_id":"SZMY-haruhi__dsh-tavily#feature-provider","repo":"SZMY-haruhi/dsh-tavily","commit":"b22e85a818738d30d2061def85b3ce088707ab67","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tavily 的功能「Tavily 网页搜索」：将 DSH web 搜索请求转发到 Tavily 并返回有链接的结果。触发方式是 DSH 发起网页搜索；查询词作为输入，搜索结果作为输出。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:150-198","lib/index.js:213-227"]}
{"unit_id":"SZMY-haruhi__dsh-tavily#feature-toggle","repo":"SZMY-haruhi/dsh-tavily","commit":"b22e85a818738d30d2061def85b3ce088707ab67","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tavily 的功能「搜索服务切换」：用户可在插件页打开或关闭 Tavily。搜索时读取凭证中的开关，关闭时调用官方 DeepSeek 提供商，开启时使用 Tavily。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:213-227","lib/client.js:540-568"]}
{"unit_id":"SZMY-haruhi__dsh-tavily#feature-probe","repo":"SZMY-haruhi/dsh-tavily","commit":"b22e85a818738d30d2061def85b3ce088707ab67","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tavily 的功能「连通测试」：用户在插件页点击测试按钮，客户端发起本地探测请求，服务端向 Tavily 执行一次搜索并返回连通状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:215-239","lib/index.js:272-294"]}
